{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"16740c8e7bb7459589847c614667d365a8c4300a2327bf891811f97aeb5c5e04","ja":"わあ～。見てみて美也ちゃん。\r\n赤くて小さくてカワイイ！　しかもキラキラ！","zh":"哇～。快看快看，美也。\n又红又小又可爱！而且还闪闪发光！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6d9c45c672729480232f41d55ae1adcfcf610bfa89a413a150fdb0f58146fc12","ja":"はい～。小さな宝石が輪になった\r\n素敵なネックレスです～。","zh":"是的～。小小的宝石围成一圈\n做成了一条漂亮的项链～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bc1e9272a661ed9ca017e0342ab1bdd61fa21aec663d71d87947ff7ffbd991fc","ja":"こっちには、ちょうちょのブローチがあります～。\n散りばめられた宝石がキラキラしてますな～。","zh":"这边有蝴蝶胸针哦～。\n上面点缀的宝石闪闪发亮呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"26bba7713d3c5d53a3a80095bb0bf7f7063155cdd0a2efcd1aef5664c9591383","ja":"ホントだ！　1回つけてみたいけど……\n係員さんにお願いしても無理かな～。","zh":"真的！想试试戴1次……\n拜托工作人员应该也不行吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c4c2b0d086e6cd609eb557c37f3dfc0fa7fec90f17008f44292065afcd2a1acf","ja":"ふたりとも、どうかしら？\n宝石の展示は楽しめてる？","zh":"你们俩觉得怎么样？\n宝石的展览看得开心吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"eb378f7c832f3fc3e3ecbd97125476aef11f7a2de3880ba81d68f539c8793130","ja":"歌織さん！　はい、とっても楽しんでます！\n全部キラキラしてて……。","zh":"歌织！　是的，我非常开心！\n全部都在闪闪发光……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"42c2c6c72efb11fd1a71ba80c28756fb64d23f81a27e1b0de674b384de8a7e54","ja":"それにかわいくて……とにかくすごいんです！\nうう、うまく言葉で説明できないんですけど……。","zh":"而且很可爱……总之就是超厉害！\n呜呜，我没法用语言好好说明……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a2b6fc8718b026ae8fee8ba2162f59f4bc2a99d07a5c79cfb7d0813e329ab293","ja":"上手に説明できなくても大丈夫ですよ、未来ちゃん。\n気持ちは、伝わってきますからね～。","zh":"就算没办法好好说明也没关系哦，小未来。\n因为你的心情已经传达过来了呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"efb2226333f3cb402b55e603ee68f1353886c77a8ade1b8d9ee4e39be962b794","ja":"ええ、本当に。ふたりとも楽しんで\nくれてるみたいで、よかったわ。","zh":"是啊，真的。看来两个人都很享受，\n真是太好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ce0c1ce40638b5e692f1755a0ed4270b3a091e3273a56037f7c1d7e709cbd7fe","ja":"それでね、せっかくだから一番の見どころは、\nみんなでって思ったんだけど……どうかしら？","zh":"所以呢，既然难得，我想最精彩的部分，\n还是大家一起……你觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"acacdd46ebb9459ca7e407478d5449f41b42b0cfa89981f8798b28ceee89f495","ja":"あっ！　そういえば主役はまだ\n見てなかったですね！　賛成です♪","zh":"啊！说起来主角还没\n看过呢！我赞成哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_931.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"74b882292eafbdd6e032d8b53c52af2ff404dbb5bf621dbe74dcde524e45a9bd","ja":"むふふ♪　それでは世界最大級の\r\nダイヤモンドの元へ、いざ参りましょう～♪","zh":"唔呼呼♪　那么，就让我们前往\n世界最大的钻石那里吧～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
